EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hi {!Lead.FirstName},

Hope you’re having a great Friday! You’ve probably noticed I’ve sent over a few emails and tried to reach you by phone. I really believe that EverQuote can help you drive more business in 2018 and I’d love to get a few minutes to show you how we can do this. 

Or you can just take it from one of our over 7,000 satisfied clients:

“EverQuote has given me the fast start I needed, and currently my agency has exceeded all company set goals and expectations.  Regardless of how many people call in or walk through my door, the quote rate with EverQuote is a vital part of my agency growth. With EverQuote we have over a 90% quote rate, and the risk filters run in line with my company’s underwriting guidelines. When I look at what I have invested in EverQuote’s product vs. gross revenue… It’s a no brainer!”
- Ladson Mills (Allstate Agent)

Do you have availability early next week to get 10 minutes on the calendar? 

What do you think?
{!User.FirstName}


{!User.Name}
Inside Sales Representative
{!User.Phone}
{!User.Email}
